      announce: "Every wall here has a door, and only I know where.", potencyDefinition: "No damage. Raise 4 berm tiles (partial cover, height +1) with one hidden passage; allies leaving through it are untargetable for that move.", expiry: "3 rounds.", dependencies: ["the berm line"],
